%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9e167393d2a1fbe4bbc781cc2706e252, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day1EnmaDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EnmaDialogueObject
  introLines:
  - character_text: Hello, Jizo.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  finalLines:
  - character_text: "Well, that\u2019s all the notes I have for your performance today. I have faith in you going forward, Jizo."
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: " Starting tomorrow, I\u2019m going to allow you to send the interviewees who approach you to the Pure Land, which for our purposes works a little differently from the other realms."
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "Normally, when you keep someone in Hell or send someone to the Human Realm, you\u2019re only sending them there for a lifetime."
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "They\u2019ll live their lifespan, accumulate their karma, and come back to be judged again."
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "It\u2019s quite mundane isn\u2019t it?"
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: But when a soul reaches the Pure Land...
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "It\u2019s removed from the cycle completely. "
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: The Buddha encourages me to send everyone I can, Tengu withholding, to the Pure Land. I suggest you do the same.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "Well... I suppose that\u2019s all we have to talk about."
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: " I hope you\u2019re enjoying your duties so far. Truthfully... after so many millennia, I\u2019d be lying if I said it\u2019s not a tedious process for me."
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: ...
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: But enough of my whining.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: Good luck tomorrow, my friend.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  person1BadLines:
  - character_text: 'That was a bold choice of you to keep that masked fellow in Hell. '
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "I know the way he talked probably irked you, but... it doesn\u2019t mean he deserved that. "
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: You need to learn how to separate your emotions from your judgment, Jizo.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  person1GoodLines:
  - character_text: That was smart of you to send that masked fellow to the Human Realm.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: ' I know his demeanor likely enticed you to keep him here, but his high karmic merit means that was the right decision.'
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: Good job, Jizo.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  person2BadLines:
  - character_text: Also, good job spotting the Tengu masquerading as that woman.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "For some reason, I\u2019ve found those beasts take a liking to imitating... temptresses."
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "Maybe that\u2019s something to look out for going forward."
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  person2GoodLines:
  - character_text: You let a Tengu into the Human Realm today...
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "It\u2019s your first day, so don\u2019t think I\u2019m upset at you or anything like that."
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: Still, that mistake was a costly one. The Buddha told me to emphasize to you the importance of keeping them here.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: You can only afford to miss one more Tengu. Any more... and I may be forced to remove you from this position, as much as I hate to say it.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  person3BadLines:
  - character_text: Hm... do you really think Lady Yanagiya deserved to stay here?
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "I suppose she was quite vain, but what noble wouldn\u2019t be? "
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "Make sure you\u2019re listening closely to what they\u2019ve done in their past lifetime."
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  person3GoodLines:
  - character_text: I think sending that Yanagiya woman back to the Human Realm was the smart call.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "She was vain, sure, but she didn\u2019t necessarily do anything egregiously against the Buddhist principles."
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: Though I would like to know more about her story... tricked by a mouse? How absurd.
    baseSprite: {fileID: -6224334638340052128, guid: 41a3e782a4efd4fd5a1712a5a30ed9bd, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
